        "original_id": "170b761d-81ef-5186-a68f-e1f4e2ca22e1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Heath Ledger, Ang Lee, Diana Ossana, James Schamus, Larry McMurtry\n- Works: Brokeback Mountain, The Dark Knight, The Joker\n- Topics: acting, directing, screenwriting, Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Heath Ledger was an Australian actor and director who was born on 4 April 1979 and died on 22 January 2008.\n- Brokeback Mountain is a 2005 American neo-western romantic drama film directed by Ang Lee and produced by Diana Ossana and James Schamus.\n- Larry McMurtry and cowriter Diana Ossana adapted the screenplay for Brokeback Mountain.\n- Brokeback Mountain received eight Academy Award nominations and won three awards, including Best Adapted Screenplay for Larry McMurtry and Diana Ossana.\n- Heath Ledger portrayed the Joker in The Dark Knight.",
